# 1. Technical Architecture

The game should be divided into independent systems.

Recommended architecture:

```text
                    GAME APPLICATION
                           │
             ┌─────────────┴─────────────┐
             │                           │
        Game State                  Input Manager
             │                           │
      ┌──────┼──────┐                    │
      │      │      │                    │
   World   Battle  Menu             UNO Q Input
      │      │      │
      └──────┼──────┘
             │
        Entity System
             │
      Rendering System
             │
        Summer Engine
             │
        Waveshare Display
```

The game should use a central state machine.

Minimum game states:

```text
BOOT
  ↓
TITLE
  ↓
OVERWORLD
  ↓
BATTLE
  ↓
CATCHING
  ↓
OVERWORLD
  ↕
MENU
```

A state must own its input handling and rendering behavior.

Do not allow individual systems to directly manipulate unrelated systems.

