## Input abstraction

Do not allow gameplay systems to directly depend on the physical joystick/buttons.

Create an abstraction such as:

```text
InputManager

is_up()
is_down()
is_left()
is_right()

button_a_pressed()
button_b_pressed()
button_menu_pressed()

button_a_just_pressed()
button_b_just_pressed()
