## MVP map

The map should contain:

```text
grass
paths
trees
rocks
water/blocked area if useful
```

The map should be small enough that the player can explore it in approximately 1–2 minutes.

Do NOT build a gigantic open world.

A small, dense map will look much more polished.

## Movement

Requirements:

* 4-direction movement
* No diagonal movement unless the hardware/game design supports it
* Collision with obstacles
* Smooth or grid-based movement depending on what produces the best Game Boy feel
* Player always visible
* Camera follows player

## Encounter zones

Define grass tiles as:

```text
encounter_zone = true
```

The encounter system should be able to query whether the player is currently inside an encounter zone.

Do not implement battle logic here.

